@startuml
' arch-lens: type=component
' arch-lens: question=Skill、CLI、Git worktree、锁定 PlantUML 运行时与受版本控制模型资产如何分工并保持源和派生视图一致？
title Arch Lens 隔离工作流职责与接口
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction

actor "AI Agent" as Agent
actor "人类审查者" as Reviewer

package "Arch Lens npm 包" as Product {
  component "Modeling & Review Skill\n语义与视觉判断" as Skill
  component "Deterministic CLI\n文件与 Git 事实" as CLI
  component "Runtime Manager" as RuntimeManager
}

package "单一 Git branch/worktree" as Worktree {
  file "principles.md\n项目原则" as Principles
  folder "changes/<id>\n唯一活动 Change Pack" as Change
  folder "diagrams/**/*.puml\n唯一可编辑业务模型" as Diagrams
  folder "rendered/**/*.svg\n受版本控制派生视图" as SVG
}

component "Git\n隔离与串行集成" as Git <<external tool>>
artifact "用户缓存\n锁定 PlantUML JAR" as ManagedPlantUML

Agent --> Skill : 建模与审查
Reviewer --> Skill : 查看当前 SVG 与 diff\n批准设计并验收实现
Skill --> CLI : 调用确定性能力
CLI --> RuntimeManager : 获取锁定运行时
RuntimeManager --> ManagedPlantUML : 安装并校验

Skill --> Worktree : 维护原则、模型、\n候选与审查证据
CLI --> Worktree : 校验单变更、基线、摘要、\nSVG freshness 与提交边界
ManagedPlantUML --> SVG : 从 .puml 生成视图
Git --> Worktree : 隔离分支并串行合入

note bottom of Skill
  逐图检查标签、交叉线、密度、边界和阅读顺序。
  存在 CONCERNS 或 FAIL 时不得请求设计批准。
end note

note bottom of CLI
  报告 SVG 摘要、viewBox、宽高和宽高比等客观事实。
  不评价设计是否清晰，不创建或合并 Git worktree。
end note

note bottom of Diagrams
  PlantUML 是唯一业务模型；SVG 不承载额外语义。
  两者必须同路径、同步并由设计批准绑定。
end note
@enduml
